// Cockpit UI: callsign, a text input. One file, no dependencies: load it with a script tag and use <cockpit-input>.
// The paintings are inside this file as data, and so is a copy of the shared core, so it works on its own.
// Do not edit between the >>> and <<< markers: tools/build.mjs writes those parts.
// 10 callsign: a text input. The painted piece has a long green window and a small one; a real text field sits in the long one and the
// character count in the small one. Typing rattles the keys; Enter registers the name and the bridge answers.
